      "id": "claim_d3a663de672a4fac9ee9401391c79095",
      "statement": "Every agent, reviewer, and scout thread runs on Managed Deep Agents (MDA) where the model loop executes. The backend refuses to start without MDA_RUNTIME_URL and MDA_RUNTIME_TOKEN_SECRET. openswe/threads/router.py serves the Agent Server's thread API from PostgreSQL and routes runs to MDA; threads created before that are read-only.",
